vkd3d-proton: shader model 6.2+ on MoltenVK without denorm modes

MoltenVK reports VK_SHADER_FLOAT_CONTROLS_INDEPENDENCE_NONE and no denorm
preserve/flush support (Metal has no per-shader denorm control), which
stopped d3d12_device_caps_init_shader_model at SM 6.0 -- 3DMark's
adapter_info showed shaderModel 6.0 for the AnyOS adapter -- and the D3D12
runtime then rejects every lib_6_3 DXIL library, i.e. all of DXR, before the
ray tracing tier is consulted.  vkd3d already drops the DXIL denorm
execution modes when the properties say unsupported (the NVIDIA exception a
few lines up relies on the same), so on MoltenVK the shader model moves on
to 6.2 and the gates that follow (6.3 ray tracing, 6.5; 6.6 still needs
compute shader derivatives).  AnyOS's inner D3D12 device only ever runs on
the gfxstream ICD in front of MoltenVK, whose driverID passes through.

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d/device.c b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
index 5b692a2..6541cac 100644
--- a/libs/vkd3d/device.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
@@ -9752,6 +9752,21 @@ static void d3d12_device_caps_init_shader_model(struct d3d12_device *device)
             }
         }
 
+        /* AnyOS: MoltenVK reports VK_SHADER_FLOAT_CONTROLS_INDEPENDENCE_NONE
+         * and no denorm preserve/flush support at all (Metal offers no
+         * per-shader denorm control), which would stop the shader model at
+         * 6.0 and reject every lib_6_3 DXIL library -- all of DXR -- before
+         * the ray tracing tier is even consulted.  The denorm execution
+         * modes are already dropped when the properties say unsupported
+         * (the same treatment as the NVIDIA exception above), so the
+         * shader model moves on without them. */
+        if (!denorm_behavior &&
+                device->device_info.vulkan_1_2_properties.driverID == VK_DRIVER_ID_MOLTENVK)
+        {
+            INFO("MoltenVK: no float-control independence; enabling SM 6.2+ without denorm modes.\n");
+            denorm_behavior = true;
+        }
+
         if (denorm_behavior)
         {
             device->d3d12_caps.max_shader_model = D3D_SHADER_MODEL_6_2;
diff --git a/subprojects/dxil-spirv b/subprojects/dxil-spirv
--- a/subprojects/dxil-spirv
+++ b/subprojects/dxil-spirv
